-- `backend/main.py` — registers the new router.
+- `backend/models.py` — `folder` fields + `TranscriptSaverFetchRequest`.
+- `backend/services/database.py` — `folder` column + migration + CRUD updates.
+- `backend/routes/transcript_saver.py` — folder pass-through on save/fetch/update.
+- `backend/services/playlist_batch.py` — `transcript_folder` on batches; parallel
